      'content' => '<h2>The Ultimate Online Scientific Calculator</h2><p>Our <strong>Scientific Calculator</strong> is a precision-engineered tool designed to handle complex mathematical operations that exceed the capabilities of standard arithmetic calculators. Whether you are solving for "Trigonometry," "Logarithms," or "Exponents," this interactive utility provides instant, high-precision results for students, engineers, and researchers. It supports a wide range of functions and nested expressions with proper <strong>Order of Operations</strong> (PEMDAS/BODMAS].</p><h3>Supported Functions and Constants</h3><p>Our advanced engine supports:
