          'q' => 'What is the 3n + 1 problem?',
          'a' => 'It is the same as the Collatz Conjecture: Odd numbers go to 3n+1, even numbers go to n/2.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Has anybody ever found a number that doesn\'t reach 1?',
          'a' => 'No. Every number tested so far eventually reaches 1.',
