          'q' => 'Does ANOVA tell me WHICH group is different?',
          'a' => 'No. It only tells you that A difference exists. To find which specific groups differ, you must perform "Post-hoc tests" like TukeyÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s HSD.',
        ),
        3 => 
