          'q' => 'What is the minimum expected frequency?',
          'a' => 'Generally, you should have an expected frequency of at least 5 in each category for the test to be valid.',
        ),
        2 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'How is it different from a t-test?',
          'a' => 'A t-test compares means of continuous data; Chi-Square compares counts/frequencies of categorical data.',
