          'question' => 'When is Secant undefined?',
          'answer' => 'Secant is undefined at 90Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â° and 270Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â° (or any odd multiple of ÃƒÂÃ¢â€šÂ¬/2] because Cosine is zero at those points.',
