      'icon' => 'fas fa-database',
      'category' => 'utility',
      'type' => 'interactive',
      'content' => '<p>Writing complex SQL queries often leads to a "wall of text" that is impossible to debug or peer-review. A missing JOIN or a nested subquery can hide in plain sight when the indentation is inconsistent. Our SQL Formatter Pro is a surgical tool that takes your messy, raw SQL and transforms it into a beautifully indented, highly readable script that clearly shows the logic of your data selection.</p><h3>What is SQL Formatting?</h3><p>SQL formatting is the application of consistent rulesÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âlike uppercasing keywords (SELECT, FROM, WHERE] and indenting clausesÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âto make a database query easier for a human to understand. Our tool doesnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t just add spaces; it understands the structure of the language, aligning your statements and making the relationship between tables and conditions visually obvious.</p><h3>How to Use the SQL Formatter Tool</h3><p>Paste your raw SQL query into the editor. Choose your dialectÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âwhether itÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, or standard T-SQLÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âand hit "Format." The tool instantly reorganizes the code. You can customize settings like "One-clause-per-line" or "Compact Mode" to suit your team\'s style guide. It is a one-click way to prep your queries for inclusion in a report or a code repository.</p><h3>The Key Features of the Tool</h3><p>Our formatter supports advanced SQL features like Window Functions, CTEs (WITH clauses], and complex JOIN operations. It features "Keyword Uppercasing," "Automatic Indentation," and "Error Highlighting" for basic syntax mistakes. The interface is optimized for speed, allowing you to beautify huge stored procedures and complex migration scripts in the blink of an eye.</p><h3>Common Use Cases</h3><p>Database administrators use this tool to clean up logs or queries captured from production performance monitors. Developers use it to ensure their code is professional and easy for colleagues to read. Technical writers use it to present SQL examples clearly in documentation. If your query looks like a giant paragraph, our formatter is the "visual architect" that brings order to the chaos.</p><h3>Why Use Our Formatter?</h3><p>We provide a premium, ad-free environment that respects the sensitivity of your database schema. Our formatting engine is the most precise in its class, handling nested logic that trips up simpler beautifiers. Most importantly, your queries stay on your machineÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âeverything happens locally in your browser. Write better code and debug faster with our professional SQL Formatter Pro.</p>',
      'processor' => 'interactive',
