      'content' => '<h2>The Geometry of a perfect Sphere</h2><p>A <strong>Sphere</strong> is a perfectly symmetrical three-dimensional solid where every point on the surface is an equal distance (the radius] from the center. It is the most efficient shape in the universe, enclosing the maximum possible volume for a given surface area. Our Volume of Sphere Calculator is a high-precision utility designed to solve for volume and surface area instantly, replacing the need for manual trigonometric calculations.</p><h3>The Math: Archimedes\' Discovery</h3><p>The formulas for a sphere were first derived by the ancient Greek mathematician Archimedes:
