<h3>Core Mechanics and Advanced Logic</h3>
<p>The mechanics behind our generator go far beyond simple random number generation. We employ a weighted probability system that aligns classes, races, and ability scores to create viable prototypes. For instance, a character generated as a "Paladin" might have prioritized Strength and Charisma scores, reflecting the classic mechanical requirements of the class, while still allowing for the variance that makes role-play exciting. Furthermore, our engine handles the complex math of level scaling. At Level 1, characters are given standard hit point (HP] pools and basic modifiers, but as you scale the starting level up to 20, the engine dynamically recalculates durability and power levels. This ensures that the character is not just a collection of numbers, but a mechanically sound entity ready for a high-level encounter or a deep-narrative backstory.</p>

